{"id":"aa2ad816ed17d60f","group":"91","path":"91/91-cor-truth-theory-hierarchy.md","title":"真理理论的保守类与强度链","display":"cor-truth-theory-hierarchy — 真理理论的保守类与强度链","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-cor-truth-theory-hierarchy","aliases":["91-cor-truth-theory-hierarchy","91-cor-theory-strength-hierarchy","91-cor-strength-ordering"],"display":"cor-truth-theory-hierarchy — 真理理论的保守类与强度链","depends_on":["[[91-thm-typed-conservative]]","[[91-df-UTB]]","[[91-df-truth-strength]]","[[91-df-FS]]","[[91-df-KF]]","[[91-df-VF]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-cor-truth-theory-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-cor-truth-theory-hierarchy</span><span>91-cor-theory-strength-hierarchy</span><span>91-cor-strength-ordering</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-truth-theory-hierarchy — 真理理论的保守类与强度链"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7e76f1ecb9ab7743\" href=\"?note=7e76f1ecb9ab7743\" title=\"91-thm-typed-conservative\">91-thm-typed-conservative</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2f215d3f10d33ae6\" href=\"?note=2f215d3f10d33ae6\" title=\"91-df-UTB\">91-df-UTB</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c87db4d1858a0009\" href=\"?note=c87db4d1858a0009\" title=\"91-df-truth-strength\">91-df-truth-strength</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25c37fe51095276d\" href=\"?note=25c37fe51095276d\" title=\"91-df-FS\">91-df-FS</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a0a2284f96eaea1d\" href=\"?note=a0a2284f96eaea1d\" title=\"91-df-KF\">91-df-KF</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"669ee474b9646a38\" href=\"?note=669ee474b9646a38\" title=\"91-df-VF\">91-df-VF</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal T)\\)</span> (理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span> 的算术后果)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> (去引号理论与基础算术)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{VF}\">\\(\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{VF}\\)</span> (自指真理理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega},\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega},\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\\)</span> (分层真理迭代理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ID}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{ID}_1\\)</span> (一个正归纳定义理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathcal A\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> (共同的算术后果类)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\equiv_{\\mathcal A}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\equiv_{\\mathcal A}\\)</span> 与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\prec_{\\mathcal A}\">\\(&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\prec_{\\mathcal A}\\)</span>\n(算术后果等强与严格包含)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{TB})\n=\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{UTB})\n=\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{PA})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{TB})\n=\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{UTB})\n=\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{PA})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以及</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FS}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega}\n&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\n\\mathrm{KF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\n&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\n\\mathrm{VF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{ID}_1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FS}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega}\n&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\n\\mathrm{KF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\n&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\n\\mathrm{VF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{ID}_1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>TB 与 UTB 虽然公理形式不同，但对算术句都保守，因而不能按算术后果\n排成严格链。对标准版本，FS、KF、VF 才有上式所示的严格证明论比较：\nFS 只达到所有有限真理层级，KF 达到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_0\">\\(\\varepsilon_0\\)</span> 以下迭代，而\nVF 达到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ID}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{ID}_1\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>“类型化/无类型”本身也不决定保守性；理论所采用的归纳、反思与规则\n必须一并指定。特别地，不能把完整 CT 与保守的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span>\n混为一谈。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-thm-typed-conservative","status":"resolved","id":"7e76f1ecb9ab7743","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-typed-conservative]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-UTB","status":"resolved","id":"2f215d3f10d33ae6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-UTB]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-strength","status":"resolved","id":"c87db4d1858a0009","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-strength]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-FS","status":"resolved","id":"25c37fe51095276d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-FS]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-KF","status":"resolved","id":"a0a2284f96eaea1d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-KF]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-VF","status":"resolved","id":"669ee474b9646a38","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-VF]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{VF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\omega},\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\varepsilon_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ID}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\equiv_{\\mathcal A}","display":false},{"tex":"<_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\prec_{\\mathcal A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{TB})\n=\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{UTB})\n=\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FS}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\omega}\n<_{\\mathrm{arith}}\n\\mathrm{KF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\varepsilon_0}\n<_{\\mathrm{arith}}\n\\mathrm{VF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{ID}_1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ID}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}","display":false}],"bytes":2077,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["7e76f1ecb9ab7743","2f215d3f10d33ae6","c87db4d1858a0009","25c37fe51095276d","a0a2284f96eaea1d","669ee474b9646a38"]}